## CHECKPOINT FORMAT

### For section-write phases (file-based):
```
✅ PHASE {N} COMPLETE — Section {S} ({Section Name}) Written

📄 File: project/output_salesforce_solution_architect/{scenario-slug}-solution-architecture.md
📋 Section: {S}. {Section Name} (`<!-- SECTION: kebab-case -->`)
📏 Section lines: ~{count} | Total deliverable now: ~{total}

📌 Substance preview (compact):
   • {key bullet 1}
   • {key bullet 2}
   • {key bullet 3}

👉 Please open and review the section in your IDE, then reply:
→ "approved"  → proceed to {next phase / sub-stop}
→ "modify ..."  → describe changes; I'll edit the file in place

🛑 STOPPING for review.
```

### For Phase 8 script + polish:
```
✅ PHASE 8c COMPLETE — Validation Script Run

📊 validate-solution-doc.js report:
   ✅ All 12 sections present (12/12)
   ✅ Mermaid lint passed (1/1 blocks)
   ⚠️ {N} numeric claims missing arithmetic block
   ⚠️ {N} cross-section entity inconsistencies

→ "fix"     → I'll apply targeted edits per findings + re-run script
→ "proceed" → Move to CP8d (Consolidate & Polish)
```

