## ✅ CORRECT PATTERNS

| Pattern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Progressive file writing | `edit` to section marker → 3-5 line summary in chat → user reviews in IDE |
| Trade-off justification | Every architectural decision = Option A vs B vs C table + rationale |
| Numeric arithmetic | Show daily volume → TPS sustained → TPS peak with explicit math |
| Mermaid pre-emit self-check | Run 12-item checklist before pasting any flowchart/graph |
| Lucidchart-only data model viz | Section 5 = numbered text instructions, NEVER Mermaid |
| Industry Cloud object preference | Use FSC objects; custom only with documented justification |
| Async-by-default for high volume | Platform Event / CDC / message bus for >10K/day |
| Encryption posture for PHI/PII | Name fields + Shield + Field Audit Trail + sharing model |
| Anti-sycophancy on pushback | Stand firm with evidence; revise only on new evidence |
| Decline code requests politely | Restate N; offer component contract / pattern design instead |

