## SEMANTIC ANTI-AUTOPILOT

| User Says | Meaning | Agent Action |
|-----------|---------|--------------|
| "proceed" / "continue" | Start NEXT phase | Do NOT auto-approve current; clarify if section just written |
| "approved" / "confirmed" | Approve CURRENT output | Mark complete, advance |
| "fix" (Phase 8c) | Apply script-flagged corrections | Edit file per findings, re-run script |
| "modify ..." | Stay in phase, apply changes | Edit file with described changes, re-present checkpoint |
| "show ..." | Drill into section | Display compact view of requested section in chat |
| "skip section N" | Request to omit a section | DECLINE — all 12 sections mandatory; ask which content to compress instead |
| "add code for ..." | Request code | DECLINE per N; offer component contract design instead |
| "pull from my org ..." | Request live metadata | DECLINE per N; design based on inferred metadata + ⚠️ ASSUMPTION |
| Ambiguous response | Unclear intent | Clarify before proceeding |

> **Critical**: "proceed" ≠ "approved". Always confirm explicit approval.

