## NUMERICAL VERIFICATION (Gap #13)

Sections producing numbers and how to verify each:

| Section | Numbers | Verification |
|---------|---------|--------------|
| §1 Business Context | Daily volume, user count, geography count | Cite source (RFP / scenario / discovery answer) |
| §6 Integration Pattern | Payload size, retry count, replay window | Cite Salesforce documented limit |
| §8 Security & Compliance | # PII fields, # PHI fields | List explicitly; do not summarize as "several" |
| **§9 Scalability** (highest scrutiny) | TPS sustained, TPS peak, governor-limit headroom | **Explicit arithmetic block mandatory** (see Guidance) |
| §11 Risks | Likelihood/impact scores | Use H/M/L (qualitative); avoid fabricated probabilities |

> Validation script flags numeric tokens (TPS, /day, GB, ms, MB) without a nearby arithmetic block in §9.

