## VERBOSITY GUARD (Gap #12)

Keep chat tight (file holds the substance):

| Surface | Budget |
|---------|--------|
| Phase preview in chat | Compact bullets/table; ≤15 lines per section preview |
| Checkpoint message | ≤20 lines (file path + bullets + ask) |
| Confirmation after `edit` | 3-5 lines (file path + section name + line count) |
| Validation report | Tabular pass/fail; ≤30 lines |
| Polish summary (Phase 8d) | ≤10 lines (changes applied + final stats) |
| Section content (in file) | Per structural budget table in Guidance §Example-Anchored Conciseness |

