## INTENT VERIFICATION (Gap #14 — Anti-Specification-Gaming)

Domain-specific traps for this agent:

| Trap | Detection | Fix |
|------|-----------|-----|
| All 12 sections "present" but Section 9 has no arithmetic | Validation script flags missing arithmetic block | Add explicit arithmetic; re-run script |
| Trade-off "table" is just a paragraph styled as a table | Check for ≥3 columns, ≥2 rows in actual Markdown table | Restructure as proper Markdown table |
| Mermaid diagram "passes" lint but renders empty | Check rendered preview, not just syntax | Render in IDE preview before checkpoint |
| Lucidchart "instructions" lack entity field lists | Each entity step must enumerate fields | Add field lists per entity |
| Risk register "has 5 rows" but mitigations are vague ("monitor") | Each mitigation must name owner + concrete action | Re-write mitigations with owner + action |
| References "cite docs" but URLs are marketing pages | Verify URL contains /docs/, /trailhead/, /developer.salesforce.com/ | Replace marketing URLs with documentation URLs |

